0";s:15:"downloadcontent";s:1:"1";s:4:"lang";s:0:"";s:4:"name";s:20:"Data Structures Quiz";}i:29;O:8:"stdClass":16:{s:2:"id";s:1:"1";s:2:"cm";s:2:"29";s:3:"mod";s:10:"customcert";s:7:"section";s:1:"4";s:13:"sectionnumber";s:1:"4";s:9:"sectionid";s:2:"26";s:6:"module";s:2:"24";s:5:"added";s:10:"1750919327";s:7:"visible";s:1:"1";s:19:"visibleoncoursepage";i:1;s:10:"visibleold";s:1:"1";s:19:"completionpassgrade";s:1:"0";s:12:"availability";s:64:"{"op":"&","c":[{"type":"grade","id":13,"min":5}],"showc":[true]}";s:15:"downloadcontent";s:1:"1";s:4:"lang";s:0:"";s:4:"name";s:29:"Course Completion Certificate";}}s:12:"sectioncache";a:9:{i:22;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"22";s:7:"section";s:1:"0";s:4:"name";s:22:"Introduction to Python";s:7:"summary";s:429:"<p data-start="180" data-end="562">This section gives you a solid foundation in Python, one of the most popular and beginner-friendly programming languages. You’ll learn what Python is, where it’s used in the real world, and why it’s in such high demand. You’ll also get hands-on experience installing Python and writing your very first program, while understanding how the Python interpreter works behind the scenes.</p>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:23;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"23";s:7:"section";s:1:"1";s:4:"name";s:13:"Python Basics";s:7:"summary";s:315:"<p>This section covers the core building blocks of Python. You’ll learn how to declare variables, understand data types, take user input, and perform basic operations. It also introduces key concepts like operators, type conversion, and writing clean, well-commented code — essential for any Python program.</p>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:24;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"24";s:7:"section";s:1:"2";s:4:"name";s:12:"Control Flow";s:7:"summary";s:687:"<p>This section teaches you how to control the direction of your program using conditional statements and loops. You'll learn to write decision-making code with <code data-start="261" data-end="265">if</code>, <code data-start="267" data-end="273">elif</code>, and <code data-start="279" data-end="285">else</code>, and use <code data-start="295" data-end="300">for</code> and <code data-start="305" data-end="312">while</code> loops to repeat actions. It also covers control statements like <code data-start="377" data-end="384">break</code>, <code data-start="386" data-end="396">continue</code>, and <code data-start="402" data-end="408">pass</code> to fine-tune how loops behave.</p>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:25;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"25";s:7:"section";s:1:"3";s:4:"name";s:21:"Functions and Modules";s:7:"summary";s:339:"<p data-start="113" data-end="411">This section introduces modular programming in Python. You’ll learn how to define and use functions to make your code reusable and organized. It also covers function parameters, return values, lambda expressions, and how to structure larger programs using Python modules for better code management.</p>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:26;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"26";s:7:"section";s:1:"4";s:4:"name";s:25:"Data Structures in Python";s:7:"summary";s:281:"<p>This section explores Python’s built-in collection types — lists, tuples, sets, and dictionaries. You’ll learn how to store, access, and manipulate data efficiently using these structures. It also introduces list comprehensions for writing cleaner, more Pythonic code.</p>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:27;O:8:"stdClass":6:{s:2:"id";s:2:"27";s:7:"section";s:1:"5";s:4:"name";s:12:"Fundamentals";s:12:"availability";N;s:9:"component";s:14:"mod_subsection";s:6:"itemid";s:1:"1";}i:28;O:8:"stdClass":6:{s:2:"id";s:2:"28";s:7:"section";s:1:"6";s:4:"name";s:5:"Logic";s:12:"availability";N;s:9:"component";s:14:"mod_subsection";s:6:"itemid";s:1:"2";}i:29;O:8:"stdClass":6:{s:2:"id";s:2:"29";s:7:"section";s:1:"7";s:4:"name";s:10:"Modularity";s:12:"availability";N;s:9:"component";s:14:"mod_subsection";s:6:"itemid";s:1:"3";}i:30;O:8:"stdClass":6:{s:2:"id";s:2:"30";s:7:"section";s:1:"8";s:4:"name";s:11:"Collections";s:12:"availability";N;s:9:"component";s:14:"mod_subsection";s:6:"itemid";s:1:"4";}}s:9:"shortname";s:6:"Python";s:8:"fullname";s:12:"Python Basic";s:6:"format";s:11:"remuiformat";s:16:"enablecompletion";s:1:"1";s:9:"groupmode";s:1:"0";s:14:"groupmodeforce";s:1:"0";s:8:"cacherev";s:10:"1767952327";}s:7:"version";i:1767952327;}